### Customers

### Create customer
POST http://localhost:8080/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah",
  "email": "sarah@example.com"
}

### Get all customers
GET http://localhost:8080/customers

### Get customer by id
GET http://localhost:8080/customers/1

### Get nonexistent customer
GET http://localhost:8080/customers/999

### Duplicate customer
POST http://localhost:8080/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate Test",
  "email": "sarah@example.com"
}

### Get customer orders
GET http://localhost:8080/customers/1/orders

### Get orders for nonexistent customer
GET http://localhost:8080/customers/999/orders

### Products

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### Get product by id
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

### Get nonexistent product
GET http://localhost:8080/products/999

### Search products
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search?name=lap

### Filter by category
GET http://localhost:8080/products/category?category=ELECTRONICS

### Create product
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Headphones",
  "description": "Wireless headphones",
  "price": 79.99,
  "quantity": 20,
  "category": "ELECTRONICS"
}

### Invalid product
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Invalid test",
  "price": -10,
  "quantity": -5,
  "category": null
}

### Orders

### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:8080/orders

### Get order by id
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/1

### Get nonexistent order
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/999

### Create order with items
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Create multi-product order
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Create order with nonexistent customer
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Insufficient stock
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1000
    }
  ]
}
